+| SCENARIO-VERIFY-5318 | Unsound SMT Hints Are Rejected Before Solving | Implemented | Artifact follows the deterministic no-LLM SMT hint fixture path across 9 hints, accepts 6 solver-valid hints, rejects 3 unsound hints, records valid_hint_acceptance_rate=1.0 and unsound_hint_rejection_rate=1.0, and keeps solver_fallback_complete=true so rejected hints fall back to the classical solver result with completeness preserved. The complete claim is limited to solver-authoritative hint validation; no retro closure, AUC/TP/FP/signed_improvement, violation_rate, live LLM quality, SOTA runtime unblock, or hardware-readiness claim is recorded. |
